a", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "index_google_identity_services", "label": "Google Identity Services (GIS) - login Google + renovaci\u00f3n silenciosa", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": 25, "source_url": "https://accounts.google.com/gsi/client", "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "FASE 2: librer\u00eda externa de Google Identity Services integrada para renovaci\u00f3n silenciosa de sesi\u00f3n en web (silent token renewal); evita que la sesi\u00f3n caduque sin interacci\u00f3n del usuario, complementando el flujo de login con Google."}, {"id": "index_google_analytics", "label": "Google Analytics (gtag G-6XDQTNYZ58)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": 5, "source_url": "https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-6XDQTNYZ58", "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Se integra Google Analytics (gtag.js) con ID G-6XDQTNYZ58 para medir el uso de la app; el dataLayer se inicializa en window antes de configurar el tag."}, {"id": "index_capacitor_runtime", "label": "Detecci\u00f3n de runtime Capacitor (app h\u00edbrida)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": 23, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "capacitor.js se carga con onerror que registra 'No Capacitor runtime' en consola: la misma p\u00e1gina corre indistintamente como app m\u00f3vil Capacitor o como web, y el c\u00f3digo distingue el entorno por runtime de Capacitor."}, {"id": "index_offline_first", "label": "Modo offline con datos guardados", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": 84, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Banner 'Sin conexi\u00f3n \u2014 mostrando datos guardados' (#offline-banner) indica que cuando no hay red se presentan datos previamente guardados en lugar de fallar; el bot\u00f3n Sincronizar (#sync-btn) permite refrescar \u00fanicamente cuando hay conexi\u00f3n."}, {"id": "index_fertrac_domain_restriction", "label": "Restricci\u00f3n de acceso a dominio @fertrac.com", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": 56, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "El acceso est\u00e1 limitado a usuarios con correo corporativo @fertrac.com; de lo contrario se muestra 'Acceso denegado' (#access-denied). Por eso el login usa identidad de Google: la direcci\u00f3n de correo corporativa valida la pertenencia a Fertrac."}, {"id": "index_pwa_manifest", "label": "PWA manifest (manifest.json + meta de instalaci\u00f3n)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": 20, "source_url": "/lista-precios-fertrac/manifest.json", "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "La app se configura como instalable/PWA: manifest.json, theme-color #1a5c2a, meta apple-mobile-web-app-capable, icono y apple-touch-icon apuntando a logo.png."}, {"id": "index_ios_install_banner", "label": "Banner de instalaci\u00f3n en iPhone (A\u00f1adir a pantalla de inicio)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": 124, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Banner instructivo (#ios-install-banner) que gu\u00eda a usuarios de iOS a tocar el \u00edcono de compartir y elegir 'A\u00f1adir a pantalla de inicio' para instalar la app en el iPhone."}], "edges": [{"source": "index_login_button", "target": "js_auth_loginwithgoogle", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "index.html", "source_location": 39, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "index_sync_button", "target": "js_catalog_syncdata", "relation": "calls"